    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56247" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καῦσος</span></b>  (A), ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>causus</i>, i.e. <i>bilious
				remittent fever</i> (the endemic fever of the Levant), <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				17
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Aph.</u>
				3.21
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				861b34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				862a2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρέττειν καύσῳ</span>”
