					Id.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					981a12
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. στομάχου</span>
			<i>heartburn</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.43
			</span></i>, al.: generally, <i>fever, heat</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				338
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in pl.,
			lands fertilized by burning brushwood, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Med.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				1.2.4
			</span></i>.</div>
